<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Route planning · D’ RAW</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/warehouse-ui.css"><style>
body{font:16px system-ui;color:#251044;background:#fff4e8;margin:0;padding:16px}button,input,select,textarea{font:inherit;min-height:46px;border:1px solid #d4c3e7;border-radius:12px;padding:10px;color:#32115d;background:white}button{cursor:pointer;background:#eee5fa}button:disabled{opacity:.5}.primary{background:#411575;color:white}.danger{background:#fff0f0;color:#a21515}.toolbar,.actions{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:end;margin:12px 0}label{display:block}label input,label select{display:block;width:100%;margin-top:5px}.board{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,330px),1fr));gap:16px}.card{background:white;border:1px solid #e3d9f2;padding:16px;border-radius:20px;margin:10px 0}.stop{border:1px solid #dfd3ec;border-radius:14px;padding:12px;margin:10px 0}.location{background:#fff4ce;border:2px solid #d8a429}.sent{opacity:.8}small{display:block;color:#6b587e}.notice{padding:12px;border-radius:12px;background:#eee5fa;white-space:pre-wrap}.notice:empty{display:none}select,textarea{max-width:100%}.stop select{width:100%}dialog{width:min(94vw,620px);border:0;border-radius:18px;max-height:90dvh;overflow:auto}dialog::backdrop{background:#25104499}dialog label{margin:12px 0}textarea{width:100%}h1{font-size:29px}h2{font-size:23px}.saved{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}#pending{background:#fff0ce;padding:12px;border-radius:12px}[hidden]{display:none!important}
</style></head><body><h1>Route planning</h1><p>Create routes, arrange stops, assign the crew, then send each route to picking.</p><div class="toolbar"><label>Route date<input id="date" type="date"></label><label>Invoice date<input id="invoice-date" type="date"></label><button id="refresh">Refresh</button><button id="auto" class="primary">Auto assign customers</button><button id="create">Create route</button></div><p id="message" class="notice" role="status"></p><div id="pending" hidden><p>A route save is waiting for confirmation. Retry the same save before making another change.</p><button id="retry">Retry saved request</button></div><section class="card"><h2>Saved route names</h2><button type="button" id="manage-saved">Add / remove saved names</button><div id="saved" class="saved"></div></section><div id="board" class="board"></div><details id="sent"><summary>Sent to picking / completed routes</summary><div id="sent-board" class="board"></div></details><script type="module" src="/workspaces-assets/planning.js"></script></body></html>
